.TH LGETXATTR 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
lgetxattr \- reads an extended attribute without following the final symbolic link
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/xattr.h>
.B ssize_t lgetxattr(const char* path, const char* name, void* value, size_t size);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads an extended attribute without following the final symbolic link. A zero size queries the required length.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lgetxattr (2)
